 s artists\, including Edgar Meyer\, Barry Tuckwell\, the Guarneri String 
 Quartet\, and members of the Baltimore and National symphony orchestras. 
 As part of the Washington D.C. music scene for over a decade (1991-2003)\
 , he performed solo and chamber recitals in many of the city's important 
 halls\, including the Kennedy Center\, the National Gallery\, the Phillip
 s Collection\, the Cosmos Club\, Strathmore Hall\, and the French Embassy
 . Recent international engagements have taken him to Taiwan\, where he pe
