 wo years at the Hochschule für Musik Hanns Eisler in Berlin with Eberhar
 d Feltz. Jagers plays a Giovanni Pistucci viola\, on loan to him from the
  Nationaal Muziekinstrumenten Fonds in Amsterdam.<br /><br />  Praised by
